{
  "_comment": "1.21.1 neoforge mod-compat batch 04 of 13: Create 6.0.0, Create: Addon Organizer, Create: Package Couriers family, Create: Package Couriers family, Decocraft, Easy NPC. Same harness row as envs/1.21.1-neoforge.json (uitest/1.21.1-neoforge), so this file adds no Gradle row; the mods below are tagged \"harness\", so jt hands their pinned jars to that row as -PjechExtraJars and it loads them exactly as it loads jech/jei — every jar dev-classpath, because a standalone row stages nothing. Targets are authored as newest-release (describe.version \"\") and pinned by jt resolve. Create: Apokinetics is skipped as an upstream defect: its GemCaseTileMixin injects GemCaseTile#upgradeGem with a Container parameter that only exists up to Apotheosis 8.8.0, while the pinned 8.9.0 dropped it. EMI is not in this batch: JEI and EMI both own Ctrl+F here (EMI's own config hard-codes focus-search as \"ctrl key.keyboard.f\"), EMI's keyboard mixin claims the press first and JEI's search bar never focuses, so EMI needs an env without JEI.",
